CHAPTER.VERS:
And if a Levite come from any of thy gates out of all Israel, where he sojourned, and come with 

          Meaning, to serve God whole heartedly, and not to seek ease.
         all the desire of his mind unto the place which the LORD shall choose;

The LORD thy God will raise up unto thee a 

          Meaning, a continual succession of prophets, till Christ, the end of all prophets, comes.
         Prophet from the midst of thee, of thy brethren, like unto me; unto him ye shall hearken;
